{
  "format": "aibdoc",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Beta.9 release notes draft 2",
  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "Page 1",
      "id": "p1",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "4178369373.4",
          "type": "blockquote",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.29",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Beta.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Builds are not code-signed. Expect rough edges. Install and download notes are the same as in "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "0.1.0 beta 1",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "title": null,
                        "class": null,
                        "href": "https://github.com/sirkuttin/AIB/releases/tag/v0.1.0-beta.1",
                        "rel": null,
                        "target": null
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Your agents no longer stall because you stepped away. In beta 9, your phone becomes a remote for every chat in AIB: approve, answer and start work from the couch, the train or the shop, for Claude Code, Codex, OMP and the rest. It runs over your own Tailscale network, so nothing goes through a cloud service of ours. You can also correct an agent mid-turn: press Enter while it works and it hears you right away, instead of finishing the wrong job first. On top of that: a tidy Artifacts list, a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "private/",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " folder every chat can see that git never commits, and an "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Update",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " button so you never miss a new AIB."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.6",
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What's new"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.7",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Remote control"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ": answer",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " your agents from your mobile phone"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "An agent that stops to ask \"may I run this?\" used to wait until you were back at your desk. Now the question reaches your pocket, and you answer it there."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.9",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.981",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.982",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Push notifications tell you the moment a chat needs you or finishes",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", even with the AIB window closed. They use standard Web Push: no account, no app store."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.1141",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.1142",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Do real work from the phone, not just watch.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Every chat is a card, needs-you first. Read along, answer questions, approve, send, stop, and check artifacts with their versions. "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "New chat",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " starts work in any project with any agent, model and mode."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.1391",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.1392",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Cross-agent:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Claude Code, Codex, OMP and the other agents all work the same from the phone."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.1487",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.1488",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Local:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " traffic stays between your phone and your PC, on your own Tailscale network, on a port of its own. The PC page's own security checks are unchanged."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.1646",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.1647",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You stay in charge of each phone.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Pair by QR code or six words, then approve it on the PC. Each phone gets its own switches (Answer, Send, Approve once, Start new chats, Push, Silent reminders), a "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Phone activity",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " log and "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Remove",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.1882",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.1883",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Set up in four buttons",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " under "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Settings → Remote control",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ". AIB runs the Tailscale commands for you, lists everything it changed on this PC, and undoes it with "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Stop sharing",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " and "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Turn off Funnel",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.2082",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.2083",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Add it to your home screen",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " with "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Install AIB",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", pick a theme per phone, and mark, rename, archive or delete chats from the card menu. Renames and unread dots carry over to the PC."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.2265",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.2266",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Closing the window keeps AIB in the tray while phone access is on",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", so your phone keeps working. "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Settings → AIB server → Keep the PC awake while AIB runs",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " stops the PC sleeping on you."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.10",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Agent steering: "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "talk to",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " the agent while it works, instead of waiting for the turn to end"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You see the agent heading the wrong way. Before, your correction sat in a queue while it finished the wrong thing. Now Claude Code, Codex and OMP hear you mid-turn and answer right away."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.12",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.2720",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.2721",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Press Enter while the agent works",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " and your message goes into the running turn. A command or helper it had running keeps going in the background, so no work is thrown away. These messages are tagged "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Sent while working",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.2944",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.2945",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Choose how hard to cut in",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " from "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Send ▾",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Send now",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " (Enter), "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Send after this turn",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " (Alt+Enter), or "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Interrupt and send",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ". Each says in one grey line what that agent will do with it."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.3130",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.3131",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Stop one runaway command without stopping the agent.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " A command moved to the background shows "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Still running in the background",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " with "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Stop",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", which ends exactly that command's processes."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.3319",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.3320",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Claude Code now writes a short reply of its own after you Stop a backgrounded command.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Expect that extra message; it is Claude Code confirming what it stopped."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.3483",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.3484",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Works from everywhere you type:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " the inbox and the phone steer the same way. A message typed while an approval card is open goes in as soon as you answer the card. Agents that can't take messages mid-turn send at the end of the turn, and slash commands and AIB's own messages, such as merge requests, always wait."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.13",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Artifacts: Archive and Delete"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " clear out the list",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Long chats pile up drafts, old mockups and dead ends until the one artifact you want is hard to find. Now you can clear them out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.15",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "by": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.3979",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.3980",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Archive",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " hides an artifact and keeps it whole. "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Archived N",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " at the foot of the list brings it back."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.4082",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.4083",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Delete removes the artifact's file too",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", into "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Recently deleted",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " for 30 days. "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Undo",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " is there for 10 seconds and "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Restore",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " after that; "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Delete now",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " removes it for good."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.4254",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.4255",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Delete won't take files that aren't the artifact's alone.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Files outside the chat's folder, in "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "aib-docs",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " or "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ".git",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", or still used by another artifact are kept."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.4418",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.4419",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Agents can tidy up too:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " ask any agent to archive its chat's artifacts. Only you can delete. Old links say "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "· archived",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " or "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "· deleted",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " instead of breaking."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.4577",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.4578",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Find both in the "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "⋯",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " menu on each artifact in the list (or right-click), and in the viewer's "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "⋯",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " menu."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.7887",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "user",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Manage non-git assets: ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "private/",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " folder keeps notes out of git and in front of every chat",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Some files should never be committed (scratch notes, plans, research), yet every agent should be able to read them. Now there's one folder for them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.18",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.4900",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.4901",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "AIB now adds ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "private/",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " to each git project's ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ".git/info/exclude",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " the first time a chat opens there, and creates an empty "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "private/",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " folder once a chat works in its own copy. That's a visible change: you'll see the folder, and git never commits it. Projects that already commit a "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "private/",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " folder are left alone."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.5224",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.5225",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Every chat sees it",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", including chats working in their own copy, under "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Files",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " with a blue "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "local only",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " label."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.5337",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.5338",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Every agent knows it's there",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", whichever provider: they're told where the local-only files are and may write there."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.5456",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.5457",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Nothing local-only leaks into main.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Files an agent writes into its own copy by mistake move to the shared folder before the copy is removed, and merges never carry them into main."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.5640",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.5641",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Make any file local-only",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " by right-clicking it in "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Files",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " and choosing "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Git exclude",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", with "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Undo",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " for 10 seconds."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.5757",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.5758",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "AIB keeps a zip backup",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " of each project's local-only files, refreshed daily when they change."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.19",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "user",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AIB Updates: Update button tells you when a new AIB is ready and installs it in one click"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.20",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.5932",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.5933",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A teal "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Update",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " button shows at the top right as soon as a new AIB is ready. One click installs it. If chats are working and can't be carried over, it waits for them to finish."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6111",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6112",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "One desktop notification per new version, even while AIB sits in the tray."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6188",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6189",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "After an update, a "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "What's new",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " tab shows what changed, newest release first."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.21",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "External File Viewer: "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "when",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "a ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "chat references a file outside the project, "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "you",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " can "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "still",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "open it",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " to view"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.22",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6336",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6337",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When an agent mentions a full path to a file outside your project, it's now a link. It opens read-only in an "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Outside this project",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " tab, and pictures show as pictures."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.23",
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fixes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.24",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6513",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6514",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Files",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " names a chat's copy after the chat, not its branch, and ignored rows say \"Ignored by git\"."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6614",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6615",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A project with no open chat shows the new-chat view instead of another project's chat, and "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Files",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " browses the project folder without a chat open."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6763",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6764",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "↓ Latest",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " no longer appears while you're following the chat with a long draft in the message box."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6864",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6865",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "New docs show in "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Files",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " right away, and doc tabs open after a restart even if their chat is gone."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.6965",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.6966",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Right-column tab labels and long project names in the sidebar now fit."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.7038",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.7039",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Very long chats no longer slow the keeper down."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.7088",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.7089",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The sidebar's ⋯ menu is gone, so there's less to click past."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.8266",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.8268",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A long, busy chat no longer jumps to the top while you read it.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.8267",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.8335",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "After you send, the text cursor stays in the message box, and it comes back there when a menu or popup closes.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.25",
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tested"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Run "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "with nothing uncommitted ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "on the release "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "branch (Windows 11); the release ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "commit "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "adds",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "only",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "README and",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "website",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ":"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4178369373.27",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "4178369373.7224",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.7225",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "App-side tests: "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1,810 passed, 0 failed, slow real-build tests included.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4178369373.7246",
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "4178369373.7247",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
